From ce8e71237a940f4b1dae20959ef16de17ba929c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:46:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Preserve watcher release policy and transient
 signatures

Released roots and all-release state outlive connection LRU eviction; genuine tracked owners reactivate only their path. Transient observations bypass connection-key memos and read semantic revisions/rows. Only the due missing-session-table fallback fingerprints the SQLite snapshot; normal stores never serialize unrelated pages.

Proof: 5 final regression failures on base, 84 tests pass across six focused files, scripts/check all 20 checks pass. Same-mtime commit, restore, WAL next-pass, owner reopening, LRU/root/all-release, reset and due-edge regressions. Missing-table fingerprint is snapshot-bound and throttled. Existing retained-reader budget unchanged. Combined deployed P1 acceptance remains with card J.
---
